LuxTime is LuxForge's single-user, local time and effort accounting tool.\par
\par
This setup installs LuxTime for local use on this machine: a Windows service that keeps its local Docker application healthy, and optional shortcuts to start and use it.\par
\par
LuxTime requires Docker Desktop (or another local Docker engine) to run its application and database containers. This installer does not install or configure Docker Desktop.\par
